OL,3,GNEWSARegeneration plans to face
OL,4,Aquestions from public
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents will have a chance to quiz
OL,7,Fcouncil chiefs over plans to redevelop
OL,8,Fa town centre.
OL,10,FBarrow is set to undergo a 10-year
OL,11,Fregeneration project, with the first
OL,12,Fphase costing about #23m expected to
OL,13,Fbring a new market village, temporary
OL,14,Ftheatre and a programme of live events.
OL,16,FThis phase was partly designed in
OL,17,Fresponse to the sudden closure of The
OL,18,FForum and Market Hall due to asbestos
OL,19,Fissue, with both set to be demolished
OL,20,Fin 2028.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
