OL,3,GNEWSARegeneration plans to face
OL,4,Aquestions from public
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam Barrow, which is leading on the
OL,7,Fproject, and Westmorland and Furness
OL,8,FCouncil will host consultation events
OL,9,Fon 2 October at Barrow Town Hall from
OL,10,F11:00 BST to 19:00 and on 3 October at
OL,11,FThe Bridge on Portland Walk from 10:00
OL,12,Fto 15:00.
